{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PhMCGOt9gD1794916539.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平會見巴布亞新幾內亞總理馬拉佩。習近平表示願同巴新方一道，推動兩國關係發展邁上新台階。</p><p></p><p>國家主席習近平表示：「中方願同巴新方一道深化政治互信，加強發展戰略對接，鞏固拓展各領域的互利合作，密切人員的交流，推動兩國關係發展不斷地邁上新的台階。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.575628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:21.207759+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:52.928771+00:00","content_hash":"c48772bca091caeb8d35f84fd9e44942e9a4066f688613c8ea2d75529ff03f0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.575628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}